  "body": "## Goal\\nReplace the current graybox battlefield presentation with a readable three-lane Ward Citadel ↔ Veil battlefield informed by the approved user reference, while preserving current combat data and phase rules. Make the roulette a friendly inspectable 3×3 picker with a selectable result list.\\n\\n## In scope\\n- New project-owned battlefield background art and runtime consumer.\\n- Three-lane visual hierarchy, strongholds, routes, terrain, current front context.\\n- Roulette board selection/readout UI; no probability-rule change.\\n- Godot/Hera visual QA and documentation.\\n\\n## Out of scope\\n- Combat/economy rule tuning, animation atlas production, title/settings screens.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n- Current main flow still reaches BATTLE without errors.\\n- Battlefield visually reads as a continuous three-lane conflict rather than graybox panels.\\n- Roulette selection exposes item/list detail without changing spin/manipulation/commit rules.\\n- Generated image is kept in project local storage and registered in Notion.",
